  "notes": "{探査|たんさ} is composed of {探|たん} (search) + {査|さ} (investigate).\n\nCOMMON USES:\n- {宇宙|うちゅう}{探査|たんさ}: space exploration\n- {火星|かせい}{探査|たんさ}: Mars exploration\n- {探査|たんさ}{機|き}: probe (spacecraft)\n- {探査|たんさ}{船|せん}: exploration vessel\n\nVS. {探検|たんけん}:\n- {探査|たんさ}: scientific/systematic investigation\n- {探検|たんけん}: adventure-style exploration",
